("c-pn",3,"3.1",True,"Pinot Noir: key traits","Thin-skinned black grape, cool to moderate climate. Pale to medium colour, high acidity, low to medium tannins, red fruit (strawberry, raspberry, red cherry). Ages to forest floor and mushroom.","26"),
("c-me",3,"3.2",True,"Merlot: key traits","Black grape, moderate to warm climate. Medium acidity and tannins. Just ripe: red fruit and green bell pepper. Riper: cooked black fruit, fuller body. Ages to dried fruit and tobacco.","48"),
("c-cs",3,"3.3",True,"Cabernet Sauvignon: key traits","Thick-skinned black grape needing a long warm season. Deep colour, high acidity, high tannins, blackcurrant, black cherry, mint or green bell pepper. Ages to dried fruit, earth, forest floor.","51"),
("c-sy",3,"3.4",True,"Syrah/Shiraz: key traits","Thick-skinned black grape, moderate to warm climate. Medium to high tannin and acidity, black fruit, black pepper. Moderate: medium body, fresh fruit, herbs. Warm: full body, cooked black fruit, liquorice.","54"),
("c-ch",3,"4.1",True,"Chardonnay: key traits","White grape for cool, moderate and warm climates. Cool: apple, lemon, wet stones, high acid. Moderate: lemon, peach, melon. Warm: peach, pineapple, banana, full body. Often shows MLC, lees or oak.","38"),
("c-sb",3,"4.2",True,"Sauvignon Blanc: key traits","Aromatic white, cool to moderate climate. Dry, high acidity, herbaceous (grass, green bell pepper, asparagus) and blossom; apple and gooseberry to passion fruit. Usually unoaked, drink young.","41"),
("c-ri",3,"4.3",True,"Riesling: key traits","Aromatic white, cool to moderate climate. High acidity, pronounced fruit and floral aromas. Dry to sweet. Just ripe: apple, lime. Riper: peach, apricot, mango. Ages to honey and petrol.","31"),
("c-pg",3,"4.4",True,"Pinot Grigio/Pinot Gris: key traits","Same white grape. High-yield, early-picked: dry, light, high acid, apple and lemon (Italian style). Low-yield, late-picked: full body, medium acid, peach, mango, ginger (Alsace style).","44"),
